                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Visa & Entry Requirements</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Most nationalities need a visa to enter Malawi:</p>
              <ul class="space-y-3">
                <li class="flex items-start group">
                  <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 bg-primary-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 mt-1">
                    <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">30-day Single Entry Visa: $75 (can be extended for 30 days)</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start group">
                  <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 bg-primary-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 mt-1">
                    <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">Transit Visa (less than 7 days): $50</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start group">
                  <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 bg-primary-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 mt-1">
                    <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary-600 transition-colors">Some nationalities can get visas on arrival, while others need to apply in advance</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="mt-4">
                <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Visa_policy_of_Malawi" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700 font-medium group">
